# CONCURRENCY

Use SQL Server rowversion on important mutable transactional/configuration tables where lost updates are a real risk.

Good candidates:
- Student;
- User/Role configuration;
- Attendance;
- Marks/Grades;
- Timetable;
- Fee/Payment;
- important mutable academic configuration.

Do not add rowversion to every static table.

Concurrent updates must not silently overwrite newer data.
